THE FACTS

I. THE CIRCUMSTANCES OF THE CASE

The applicant was born in 1956. At the time the application was lodged he lived in Elgoibar (Gipuzkoa).

At the time of the events, the applicant was spokesperson for Sozialista Abertzaleak, a left-wing Basque separatist parliamentary group in the Parliament of the Autonomous Community of the Basque Country.



